  phaseName: The Mountain Path
  description: 'Your body is heavy.You are tired. You are wounded. Every step sends
    pain through your legs and chest.The path ahead is narrow and tortuous. The stones
    are uneven and sharp. The mountainous terrain twists and rises without mercy,
    forcing you to watch every footstep. There is no clear direction.The only sound
    that follows you is the long, cold howl of the wind as it cuts through the mountains. '
